---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/SchoolDayStoryLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import assemblyPrayer from "../../../assets/photos/shared/assembly-prayer-01.jpg";
---

<Layout
  title="About the School — A School Day Story — Green Valley Matriculation School"
  description="How Green Valley Matriculation School began, and a message from the Principal."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our Story</p>
    <h1>Before the gates open each morning.</h1>
    <p class="hero-lede">
      Green Valley Matriculation School is a Kindergarten–Class 10 school in Nagercoil, Tamil Nadu.
      This is the story behind the story.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="story-image">
    <Image src={assemblyPrayer} alt="Students standing together for morning assembly and prayer" width={1800} height={800} />
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our Beginning</p>
    <h2>Founded around one idea.</h2>
    <p>
      Green Valley Matriculation School was founded on a simple belief: that a good education
      isn't one big moment, but the accumulation of ordinary, well-spent days.
      <em>(Placeholder history — founding year and milestones to be confirmed with the school.)</em>
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Vision.</strong> Students who leave with strong foundations, confident character,
      and a lifelong love of learning.
      <br /><strong>Mission.</strong> To make every ordinary school day count.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section principal-section" id="principal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Leadership</p>
    <h2>A message from the Principal.</h2>
    <blockquote class="pull-quote">
      A school day should ask a lot of a child — and give them just as much back. We try to
      make sure every one of ours does.
    </blockquote>
    <p class="principal-attribution">— Mrs. Lakshmi Narayanan, Principal <em>(placeholder name)</em></p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .story-image { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto 4rem; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
  .story-image :global(img) { border-radius: 8px; height: 340px; object-fit: cover; width: 100%; }

  .pull-quote {
    font-family: "Lora", serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--plum-900);
    margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--terracotta-600);
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }
  .principal-attribution { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
</style>
